OL,3,GNEWSAModel car museum 'last lap' to
OL,4,Araise charity funds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA closed motorsport memorabilia museum
OL,7,Fis reopening over the August bank
OL,8,Fholiday weekend for a "last lap" to
OL,9,Fraise money for charity.
OL,11,FThe family-run On Your Marques Model
OL,12,FCar Museum in Mumby, Lincolnshire, has
OL,13,Fbeen closed since 2023 due to the
OL,14,Fowners' ill health.
OL,16,FThe museum is reopening from 10:00
OL,17,Funtil 16:00 BST on Saturday, Sunday and
OL,18,FMonday to raise funds for the National
OL,19,FBrain Appeal's Dementia Research Fund.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
